#. i18n: file: imapsettings.ui:165
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, storePasswordCheck)
#: rc.cpp:119
msgid ""
"Check this option to have KMail store the password.\n"
"If KWallet is available the password will be stored there which is "
"considered safe.\n"
"However, if KWallet is not available, the password will be stored in KMail's "
"configuration file. The password is stored in an obfuscated format, but "
"should not be considered secure from decryption efforts if access to the "
"configuration file is obtained."
msgstr ""
"Active esta opción para que KMail garde o contrasinal.\n"
"Se KWallet está dispoñíbel, o contrasinal gravarase alí, o que se considera "
"seguro.\n"
"Porén, se KWallet non está dispoñíbel, o contrasinal gravarase no ficheiro "
"de configuración de KMail. O contrasinal grávase nun formato oculto, pero "
"non se pode considerar a salvo de que o descifren se se obtén acceso ao "
"ficheiro de configuración."

