msgid "&HTTP Requests"
msgstr "Solicitudes &HTTP"

#. i18n: file: smimeconfiguration.ui:137
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, disableHTTPCB)
#: rc.cpp:978
msgid "Entirely disables the use of HTTP for S/MIME."
msgstr "Deshabilita completamente o uso de HTTP para S/MIME."

#. i18n: file: smimeconfiguration.ui:140
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, disableHTTPCB)
#: rc.cpp:981
msgid "Do not perform any HTTP requests"
msgstr "Non efectuar ningunha solicitude HTTP"

#. i18n: file: smimeconfiguration.ui:147
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, ignoreHTTPDPCB)
#: rc.cpp:984
msgid ""
"When looking for the location of a CRL, the to-be-tested certificate usually "
"contains what are known as \"CRL Distribution Point\" (DP) entries, which "
"are URLs describing the way to access the URL. The first found DP entry is "
"used.  With this option all entries using the HTTP scheme are ignored when "
"looking for a suitable DP."
msgstr ""
"Cando se procura pola localización dun CRL, o certificado a comprobar contén "
"normalmente o que se coñecen como entradas \"Punto de Distribución CRL"
"\" (DP), que son URLs que describen o xeito de acceder ao URL. Úsase a "
"primeira entrada DP atopada. Con esta opción, ignóranse todas as entradas "
"que usen o esquema HTTP cando se procure por un DP axeitado."

#. i18n: file: smimeconfiguration.ui:150
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, ignoreHTTPDPCB)
#: rc.cpp:987
msgid "Ignore HTTP CRL distribution point of certificates"
msgstr "Ignorar punto de distribución de certificados HTTP CRL"

#. i18n: file: smimeconfiguration.ui:161
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QRadioButton, honorHTTPProxyRB)
#: rc.cpp:990
msgid ""
"If this option is selected, the value of the HTTP proxy shown on the right "
"(which comes from the environment variable http_proxy) will be used for any "
"HTTP request."
msgstr ""
"Se se selecciona esta opción, empregarase o valor do proxy HTTP amosado á "
"dereita (que provén da variábel de ambiente http_proxy) para calquera "
"solicitude HTTP."

#. i18n: file: smimeconfiguration.ui:164
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QRadioButton, honorHTTPProxyRB)
#: rc.cpp:993
msgid "Use system HTTP proxy:"
msgstr "Empregar o proxy HTTP do sistema:"

